      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0071",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "核心主张：“诚实设计”——忠实于材料、结构、功能",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0072",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "推崇中世纪哥特式风格，认为其体现工匠的自由与虔诚",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0073",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "对工业化的批判：机器剥夺工匠创造的乐趣",
